s1","text":"Zero third-party Python dependencies — pure standard library (`chardet` / `tree-sitter` are optional"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" enhancements with graceful fallback)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Requires Node.js ≥ 18 and `python3` (≥ 3.9) on `PATH`. This package ships as a DSH **bundle** (`dsh."},{"id":"p9s2","text":"bundle`), installed into a profile via `dsh plugin`:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Verify the layer landed before launching:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Field | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `pythonPath` | `python3` | Executable used to run the bundled Python tools |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- The JS layer only defines tool schemas and bridges to subprocesses.\n- The Python core comes from i"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"rmia_devkit_open v2.6.4, unmodified.\n- Per-tool behavior (arguments, guards, return protocol) is pre"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"n v2.6.4, unmodified.\n- Per-tool behavior (arguments, guards, return protocol) is preserved exactly."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Repo-internal design docs: `docs/COMPARISON.md` (DevKit ↔ Harness tool comparison) and `docs/PORTING"},{"id":"p21s2","text":".md` (port blueprint)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**AGPL-3.0**. Python tool core © 2026 伊尔弥亚 / irmia2026, from Irmia DevKit, AGPL-3.0. This repository"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" is a derivative work distributed under AGPL-3.0."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
